# G11: the DOS zoom keys made through the real INT 16h of DOSBox's keyboard (dos/tools/keys-x11.sh sends Alt+keypad plus, Alt+minus,
# Alt+keypad minus and Alt+0 with xdotool in a virtual X server). From 100 percent: 125, 100, 75, 100, 125, Page Width, 75. The run's
# last frame before it exits must be this scenario's last frame.
@copy letter.rtf
@open LETTER.RTF
altplus
altminus
altminus
altplus
altplus
alt0
altplus
